OL,3,GNEWSAMy magical daughter went to school
OL,4,Aand never came home - I want everyone
OL,5,Ato remember her
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I know I'm biased because she was
OL,8,Fmine, but she was the best human I've
OL,9,Fever met," says Aaron John Huxter of
OL,10,Fhis daughter Olivia-Grace.
OL,12,FThe 33-year-old said his "entire world
OL,13,Fcrumbled from a phone call" when he was
OL,14,Ftold his eight-year-old daughter had
OL,15,Ffallen at her school in Rhondda Cynon
OL,16,FTaf.
OL,18,FHe was more than an hour's drive away,
OL,19,Fand when he was just around the corner,
OL,20,Fhe was told they had restarted her
OL,21,Fheart.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
