OL,3,GNEWSAMy magical daughter went to school
OL,4,Aand never came home - I want everyone
OL,5,Ato remember her
OL,6,
OL,7,FAaron said he got out of his van and
OL,8,Fcollapsed in shock, before being taken
OL,9,Fto the ambulance where a paramedic told
OL,10,Fhim: "We've stabilised her but you have
OL,11,Fa very, very sick little girl."
